  "instance_name": "holocaust_minimization_mapping",
  "label": "The Holocaust is mapped onto a 'sad moment in history' through the visual of Adolf Hitler",
  "description": "The text 'the holocaust is a sad moment in history' is juxtaposed with the visual of Adolf Hitler, a central figure in the Holocaust. This creates an analogical mapping where the historical event (Holocaust) is being equated with a trivial concept ('sad moment'), using Hitler's image to anchor the text in a context of historical horror. The mapping is harmful as it minimizes the genocide, requiring external knowledge to understand the gravity of the event being trivialized.",
